listing:   pingpong.cc
toolchain: mpirun (Open MPI) 4.1.6; g++ (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0
command:   mpic++ -std=c++20 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror -DOMPI_SKIP_MPICXX pingpong.cc -o pingpong; timeout 120 mpirun --allow-run-as-root --oversubscribe -np 2 ./pingpong
date:      2026-10-10T00:05:09Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container, 4 logical CPUs shared with other jobs; MPI processes on one machine, no GPU)
exit code: 0
